{"sections":[{"slug":"佐武等价","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"佐武等价"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">佐武等价</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"佐武等价"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">佐武</span> (Satake) <span lang=\"zh\">等价</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Langlands对偶","text":"Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">对偶群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的一种</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">实现</span>”: <span lang=\"zh\">由</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">构造的某个几何对象上的某种层范畴实现了其对偶群</span> $^LG$ <span lang=\"zh\">的表示范畴</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">几何佐武等价是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/几何Langlands对应","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何</span> Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">对应</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的基石</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">陈述</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">几何佐武等价</span></h3>\n<h4><span lang=\"zh\">偏屈层版本</span></h4>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/仿射Grassmann空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射</span> Grassmann <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$\\mathrm{Gr}_G$\n<span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/弧群","text":"$L^+G$"}},{"Plain":"-<span lang=\"zh\">等变</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/偏屈层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">偏屈层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Abel范畴","text":"Abel <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf{Perv}_{L^+G}(\\mathrm{Gr}_G)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是等变导出范畴上某个偏屈</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/t-结构","text":"t-<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的心</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且继承了导出范畴上的卷积</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">构成</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">几何佐武等价指出这个幺半范畴等价于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Langlands对偶","text":"Langlands <span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $G^\\vee$ <span lang=\"zh\">的表示范畴</span>,\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Perv}_{L^+G}(\\mathrm{Gr}_G) \\simeq \\mathsf{Rep}(G^\\vee).\r\n$$</p>\n<h4>D-<span lang=\"zh\">模版本</span></h4>\n"}]}}}]}